{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33947","headline":"鲁望春日多寻野景日休抱疾杜门因有是寄 · 皮日休","name":"鲁望春日多寻野景日休抱疾杜门因有是寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野侣相逢不待期，半缘幽事半缘诗。\n乌纱任岸穿筋竹，白袷从披趁肉芝。\n数卷蠹书棊处展，几升菰米钓前炊。\n病中不用君相忆，折取山樱寄一枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}